{"strongs": "H5397", "word": "נְשָׁמָה", "translit": "ne.sha.mah", "root": "נשמה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "breath", "definition": "נְשָׁמָה noun feminine breath ; — ׳ נ Deut 20:16 + 9 t.; construct נִשְׁמַת (compare Lag BN 82 ) Gen 2:7 + 10 t.; suffix נִשְׁמָתִי Job 27:3 נִשְׁמָתוֺ Job 34:14 plural נְשָׁמוֺת Isa 57:16 — 1. breath of God as hot wind kindling a flame Isa 30:33 as destroying wind 2Sam 22:16 = Ps 18:16 ; Job 4:9 as cold wind producing ice Job 32:8 ; Job 33:4 . 2. breath of man 1Kgs 17:17 ; Isa 42:5 ; Job 27:3 ; Dan 10:7 breath of life נשׁמת חיים Gen 2:7 ( J ); compare נִשְׁמַת רוּחַ חַיִּים Gen 7:22 ( J ); as breathed in by God it is God's breath in man Job 34:14 ; Job 36:4 and is characteristic of man אדם אשׁר נשׁמה באפו Isa 2:22 man in whose nostrils is but a breath (late gloss). 3. synonym נפשׁ כָּל נְשָׁמָה every breathing thing Deut 20:16 ; Josh 11:11 ; Josh 11:14 ; 1Kgs 15:29 כָּלהַֿנְּשָׁמָה Josh 10:14 ; Ps 150:6 נְשָׁמוֺת Isa 57:16 . 4. spirit of man, || רוּחַ , אָדָם ׳ נ ׳ נֵר י Prov 20:27 the spirit of man is a lamp of ׳ י .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5422')\">BDB5422</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5397')\">H5397</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5421')\">BDB5421</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5423')\">BDB5423</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נְשָׁמָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>breath</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 20:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,16)\">Deut 20:16</ref> + 9 t.; construct <bdbheb>נִשְׁמַת</bdbheb> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 82</sup></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Gen 2:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,7)\">Gen 2:7</ref> + 10 t.; suffix <bdbheb>נִשְׁמָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 27:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,3)\">Job 27:3</ref> <bdbheb>נִשְׁמָתוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 34:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,14)\">Job 34:14</ref> plural <bdbheb>נְשָׁמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 57:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,16)\">Isa 57:16</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>breath</highlight> of God as hot wind kindling a flame <ref ref=\"Isa 30:33\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,33)\">Isa 30:33</ref> as destroying wind <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,16)\">2Sam 22:16</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 18:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,16)\">Ps 18:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 4:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,9)\">Job 4:9</ref> as cold wind producing ice <ref ref=\"Job 32:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,8)\">Job 32:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 33:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,4)\">Job 33:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>breath of</highlight> man <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:17\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,17)\">1Kgs 17:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 42:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,5)\">Isa 42:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 27:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,3)\">Job 27:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 10:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,7)\">Dan 10:7</ref> breath of life <bdbheb>נשׁמת חיים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 2:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,7)\">Gen 2:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</ref